      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Solid: command or Supervise rule. Dashed: Advance rule. Setpoint every cycle in S2, never in S1. T3, T5, T13 are internal.",
      "originalText": "Solid: command or Supervise rule. Dashed: Advance rule. Setpoint every cycle in S2, never in S1. T3, T5, T13 are internal.",
